><li>Up the <a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Glacier\">Formorgar Glacier</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32135,31103,2\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32135, 31103, 2)</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32167,31143,2\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32167, 31143, 2)</a> and <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32142,31178,2\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32142, 31178, 2)</a></li>\n<li>At <a href=\"#/wiki/Helheim\">Helheim</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32480,31160,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32480, 31160, 7)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tyrsung\">Tyrsung</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32342,31212,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32342, 31212, 7)</a></li>\n<li>West of <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32182,31160,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32182, 31160, 7)</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32204,31213,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32204, 31213, 7)</a> and <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32189,31245,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32189, 31245, 7)</a></li>\n<li>Way to <a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32072,31081,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32072, 31081, 7)</a>, even though no regular penguins spawn there.</li>\n<li>North of <a href=\"#/wiki/Bittermor\">Bittermor</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31986,31181,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (31986, 31181, 7)</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tChases the opponent shooting stones and casting paralyze bomb around itself. It moves objects but doesn't kill weaker creatures.<br/><br/>A dire penguin attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tKill them with melee or use energy based attacks.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\